ory":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. September to October came in under 90% of normal in 35 of those years, the most of any pair. In 2025, August to September came in at 42% of normal and November to December at 39%. So far in 2026, March to April sits at 74% and June to July at 79%.</p>"}
